## twink

i know the code isn't exactly perfect right now, 
and some people might criticize me for it—but i don't deny that the code is terrible. 
it wouldn't be honest to claim i wrote it entirely myself. 
i used ai in some places and copied from github in others.

if you happen to want to help the project (though it's unlikely), 
you can send over some code. 
i’d be happy to accept it.

i would like to thank https://github.com/mbrubeck/ for writing Robinson. 
i don't know how i would have written this browser engine without you.

